-- Seal of Ascension (12344), the UBRS door key: quest 4743 rewards it and classic_instance_blackrock_spire opens the door for a
-- player carrying it, but the 70374 client has no item 12344 (".additem 12344" = "Invalid item id"; 12219 / 12323 / 12324 exist),
-- so the quest reward failed and the door stayed shut. One item + item_sparse pair, sent to clients through hotfix_data like
-- the sniff items (2026_10_01_02_hotfixes_forever_sniff.sql). Class 13 Key, unique, binds on pickup, item level 60, rare.
-- Icon 133344 is a ring icon from the sniff rows; vanilla shows INV_Jewelry_Ring_28 (swap the IconFileDataID when known).
